00:42:13.323 --> 00:42:15.158
[In-ho dan Soo-jeong merengek]

842
00:42:16.952 --> 00:42:18.078
[periuk tekanan bersiul]

843
00:42:18.995 --> 00:42:21.997
Bagaimana jika mereka tidak berubah
betul bila mereka digigit?

844
00:42:21.998 --> 00:42:23.166
Oh, Tuhanku.

845
00:42:25.794 --> 00:42:27.045
[bersambung]

846
00:42:30.590 --> 00:42:31.423
[merengus]

847
00:42:31.424 --> 00:42:33.050
[Soo-jeong tersentak]

848
00:42:33.051 --> 00:42:34.344
[Chul-woo geram]

849
00:42:35.470 --> 00:42:37.179
- [Hyung-bae] Choi--
- [Pemuda] Hah?

850
00:42:37.180 --> 00:42:38.889
[Tae-hwa] Ch-- Choi Chul-woo?

851
00:42:38.890 --> 00:42:41.267
- [ketawa] Chul-woo!
- Jangan pergi ke luar sana.

852
00:42:41.268 --> 00:42:43.978
- [Hyung-bae] Chul-woo.
- [Soo-jeong] Jangan pergi. Tutup pintu.

853
00:42:43.979 --> 00:42:44.938
Hei.

854
00:42:46.356 --> 00:42:48.233
- [menggertak]
- [Hyung-bae] Chul-woo.

855
00:42:48.817 --> 00:42:51.236
- [merengus]
- [menggertak]

856
00:42:54.739 --> 00:42:55.949
[Hyung-bae merengek]

857
00:42:58.201 --> 00:43:00.160
[mengerang]

858
00:43:00.161 --> 00:43:01.913
[menjerit]

859
00:43:10.839 --> 00:43:13.465
- [Gye-young] Seseorang dapatkan dia.
- [Pemuda] Tunggu.

860
00:43:13.466 --> 00:43:14.968
[Gye-muda merengek]

861
00:43:15.552 --> 00:43:17.387
- [Chul-woo geram]
- [semua menjerit]

862
00:43:21.308 --> 00:43:23.517
- [Hyung-bae] Chul-woo.
- [Gye-young] Hyung-bae

863
00:43:23.518 --> 00:43:27.146
Saya minta maaf kerana saya bertanya kepada awak
untuk melakukan pencekik guillotine.

864
00:43:27.147 --> 00:43:28.939
- Hyung-bae!
- [Chul-woo geram]

865
00:43:28.940 --> 00:43:29.858
Hyung-bae.

866
00:43:32.819 --> 00:43:34.778
- [Gye-young] Kami dapat awak.
- [Jae-yoon] Oh!

867
00:43:34.779 --> 00:43:36.448
[Tae-hwa merengus]

868
00:43:37.240 --> 00:43:38.615
Bawakan saya senapang dan selimut.

869
00:43:38.616 --> 00:43:39.909
Persendirian Hwang Kyung-sik!

870
00:43:40.452 --> 00:43:42.161
[Gye-young] Koperal Jeon Hyung-bae!

871
00:43:42.162 --> 00:43:43.787
Hyung-bae, awak okay?

872
00:43:43.788 --> 00:43:45.164
Awak akan terbunuh.

873
00:43:45.165 --> 00:43:46.374
Saya mendapat satu idea.

874
00:43:52.505 --> 00:43:53.923
Yeah, yeah.

875
00:43:54.632 --> 00:43:57.051
Ayuh, cepat! Cepatlah!

876
00:43:57.052 --> 00:43:58.053
[Gye-young] Tolong saya!

877
00:43:58.553 --> 00:43:59.887
[menjerit]

878
00:43:59.888 --> 00:44:01.055
Saya akan masuk.

879
00:44:01.056 --> 00:44:03.141
[Tae-hwa menjerit]

880
00:44:04.434 --> 00:44:06.144
[Jae-yoon merengus]

881
00:44:07.187 --> 00:44:08.270
[Chul-woo geram]

882
00:44:08.271 --> 00:44:10.522
Adakah awak masih bersama saya? Hyung-bae?

883
00:44:10.523 --> 00:44:11.858
- Hyung-bae.
- Dia bukan--

884
00:44:15.487 --> 00:44:17.613
Saya akan melakukan CPR.
Sila selamatkan saluran pernafasan.

885
00:44:17.614 --> 00:44:20.407
- Awak buat apa?
- Apa saya-- Ini CPR!

886
00:44:20.408 --> 00:44:22.452
Ugh, anda sepatutnya tahu perkara ini.

887
00:44:23.119 --> 00:44:26.038
Dia tidak boleh mati dengan cara ini.
Kemudian dia akan bertukar menjadi zombi.

888
00:44:26.039 --> 00:44:27.123
[Gye-young] Okay.

889
00:44:28.375 --> 00:44:31.877
Satu, dua, tiga, empat
lima, enam, tujuh, lapan...

890
00:44:31.878 --> 00:44:32.961
sembilan, sepuluh.

891
00:44:32.962 --> 00:44:35.714
Satu, dua, tiga, empat lima, enam--

892
00:44:35.715 --> 00:44:36.965
- Tunggu.
- Anda boleh--

893
00:44:36.966 --> 00:44:38.384
Tidak, kepalanya!

894
00:44:38.385 --> 00:44:41.095
- Oh, sial.
- Oh. Bawakan kami tuala.

895
00:44:41.096 --> 00:44:42.304
apa? awak nak--

896
00:44:42.305 --> 00:44:44.765
- [Soo-jeong] Tolong, cuma--
- [In-ho] Okay.

897
00:44:44.766 --> 00:44:46.475
[Jae-yoon] Ah! Dia akan membunuh saya.

898
00:44:46.476 --> 00:44:47.393
[In-ho merengus]

899
00:44:47.394 --> 00:44:49.186
[Jae-yoon] ...bunuh saya. Oh, Tuhan.

900
00:44:49.187 --> 00:44:51.314
- [In-ho menjerit]
- [Jae-yoon] Dapatkannya, dapatkannya.

901
00:44:53.441 --> 00:44:55.317
- [ayam senapang]
- Sekarang, kembali!

902
00:44:55.318 --> 00:44:57.653
- Anak muda, adakah anda bersedia?
- Ya, tuan. saya dah bersedia.

903
00:44:57.654 --> 00:45:00.198
- Api!
- [In-ho merengek]

904
00:45:01.699 --> 00:45:02.950
[Chul-woo berdebar]

905
00:45:02.951 --> 00:45:05.828
[In-ho tercungap-cungap]

906
00:45:05.829 --> 00:45:08.288
- [Chul-woo geram]
- [In-ho menjerit, menjerit]

907
00:45:08.289 --> 00:45:11.542
- Oh, sial. Apa yang kita buat?
- Anda perlu menembaknya di kepala.

908
00:45:11.543 --> 00:45:13.043
- Api terbuka!
- [In-ho tersentak]

909
00:45:13.044 --> 00:45:14.671
[selongsong cangkerang berdenting di atas lantai]

910
00:45:15.380 --> 00:45:17.382
[muzik serius dimainkan]

911
00:46:21.696 --> 00:46:23.698
[muzik aneh dimainkan]

912
00:47:51.244 --> 00:47:53.246
[muzik kugiran kawad dimainkan]

913
00:49:06.861 --> 00:49:08.905
[muzik huru hara dimainkan]

914
00:50:13.469 --> 00:50:15.471
[muzik pudar]

